	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=1, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=2, time=1500},
		{"sestop", id=3, time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020040"},
		line=880,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			{
"The moment we open the door, the frenzied fervor of the room rushes out to meet us.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"There is hardly even any standing room in the crowded headquarters, and every last warrior assembled is engaged in vigorous argument.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"Not a single person pays any mind to the scattered documents and haphazardly strewn teacups all across the floor.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“A-Awfully agitated, aren't they?”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Stick close by my side.”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"Akari nods, clutching tightly to my sleeve.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Order! Order!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			{
"The vociferous din grinds to an immediate halt.",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			{
"Hotori slowly glides between the silent warriors as she moves to take her place in the chairman's seat.",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"Already seated at her right hand, Maki watches her with his arms crossed.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			{
"The vice chairman continues wordlessly regarding her even as Hotori prepares to sit down.",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You came?”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Nothin' better to do.”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			{
"Maki drawls in a seemingly disinterested voice, wriggling his broad nose at the question.",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I see you're wounded.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Drink a bit too much durin' the festival and fall down some stairs?”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Or did you burn yourself playin' with fire at the ceremony?”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"Maki is not so subtly alluding to the explosions at the Armistice Day ceremony.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“No chance.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“In fact, I thought those explosions might've been your handiwork.”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“No self-respectin' warrior would stoop to playin' cheap tricks with fireworks.”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Good to hear.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Satisfied, Hotori finally takes her seat.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			{
"Akari and I assume positions behind her seat of honor.",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			{
"Maki turns and cocks an eyebrow at Akari's presence.",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hmm, ain't you that same girlie from the other day?”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Didja take a wrong turn and get lost?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“She's an unofficial member of the Sworn Blades, here on my express authority.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I see. That fly with you, Mister Inspector General?”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The acting chairman has made her decision.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“My name is...”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Miyaguni Akari, ain't it? I know.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That spares me the trouble then. I look forward to working together.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Maki responds with only a slight incline of his head.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Acting chairman, let's get down to business.”",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Yeah, you're right.”",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"Hotori affirms, surveying the tense atmosphere within the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I want a sitrep on our losses.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			{
"The Blade's spymaster begins reading aloud his prepared documents.",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"We've suffered catastrophic losses at our off-site arsenal.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"The raid was conducted by the Republican Army, under\nElsa's command.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"The warrior overseeing the arsenal and two priestesses performing routine Honings were killed in action.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			{
"Following that, the Republican Army plundered approximately seventy percent of the spellblades we worked so hard to collect.",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"The extent of the damages is staggering.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			{
"Personnel losses aside, the materiel losses in spellblades make for a truly devastating blow.",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"A seventy-percent reduction in our armaments means that nearly all of our warriors will be forced to fight with conventional blades.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			{
"With the exception of elite fighters like Hotori and Kazuma, this means most warriors will only be able to take on five-to-one numerical odds.",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"The Sworn Blades only number two hundred at present.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			{
"Meanwhile, our objective is to challenge Okonogi and his two thousand-strong Forbidden Guard.",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"As things currently stand, we have absolutely no chance.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"Upon hearing the dismal report, Hotori remains silent, biting her lip hard enough to draw blood.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			{
"─The Sworn Blades are finished.",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"More than a few warriors are surely thinking this right now.",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Gonna spend another three long years gatherin' spellblades, acting chairman?”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Before anything else, a moment of silence for the fallen.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa!”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“A moment of silence!”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"I squeeze my eyes shut.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"The entire headquarters is enveloped in a silence so thick I could choke on it.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"Even though over a hundred warriors are present, not a single one dares so much as breathe loudly enough to hear.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"The stifling atmosphere here resembles that of the aftermath of the August Incident.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"Even the most steadfast members are right on the verge of losing all hope.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"Everything will be decided in the next few moments.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"If Hotori doesn't manage to steer the right course, the Sworn Blades will collapse into ruin.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“At ease!”",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“So, what's the call, acting chairman? We collectin' spellblades again from scratch?”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Of course.”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“To hell with that.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			{
"Clutching his blade, Kazuma roughly stands up.",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Where do you think you're going?”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I'm gonna storm the Imperial Palace.”",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“That's suicide.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What do you think is going to happen if we fight without spellblades?”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Especially now of all times, with security on high alert after the...”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I don't give a rat's ass about that!”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“We're warriors, dammit! Ours is but to do and die!”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“I ain't gonna put up with one more goddamn second of\nsittin' on our asses and collectin' blades!”",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Kazuma roars as he swings his fist down, staving a mighty dent into the conference table.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			{
"Unperturbed, Hotori continues coolly staring at Kazuma.",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			{
"It's all come down to this: Inou versus Maki.",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"It's the showdown that everyone saw coming.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"At my side, Akari silently regards the two of them, her mouth pursed into a narrow line.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"It seems like she has no intention of speaking up.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I refuse to sanction a battle where defeat is all but certain.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we lose any more comrades on top of our current losses, the Blades will truly be finished.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"The warriors of Maki's faction account for nearly forty percent of our membership.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			{
"If all of them are wiped out, it will be just as Hotori says.",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Endure, endure, endure! That's all it's ever been from you!”",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Enough is enough, goddammit! Victory ain't ever guaranteed no matter how long we wait!”",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“We'd've stood a better chance if we'd just stormed the stage during the ceremony!”",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We already gave up on that idea. Show the same wisdom you did back then.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"Kazuma grinds his teeth at Hotori's measured response.",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Give it to us straight, ma'am. Won'tcha just say that you're scared of dyin'?”",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Maki, you go too far.”",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Shut the fuck up, Tokita!”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"The conference table collapses into splinters.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“So, what's the deal, acting chairman?”",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Truth is, you've lost your nerve, ain't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Don't you dare ask that ever again.”",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Their deadly-sharp glares clash against each other.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Reporting in with urgent news, ma'am!”",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"Koyuzu tumbles headfirst into the tense atmosphere of the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			{
"She's been deep undercover within the Republican Army garrison for the past several days.",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Tch...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What is it? New intelligence on troop movements?”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“This is much more top-priority than that!”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Kokuan-sama is alive!”",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“My father?!”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes! Inou Kokuan-sama is currently imprisoned within the Imperial Palace!”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kokuan-dono is...”",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Still kickin'?”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			{
"Ripples of murmuring immediately spread across the crowds of warriors.",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"Along with Hotori and the manager, I owe a great debt of gratitude to Kokuan-dono for supporting me after I lost my memories during the war.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"If he truly still lives, then there could be no happier news.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			{
"Inou Kokuan-dono, Hotori's father and chairman of the Sworn Blades, was arrested by the Republic on August 8th two years ago.",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"This fateful day was the so-called August Incident.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"On that day, right on the eve of our planned uprising, a special forces unit led by Elsa raided the Sworn Blades' former headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"Even now, I still remember it like it was just yesterday.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"The echoing gunshots, the panicked screams... and the cloying stench of blood.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono made the difficult decision to keep the Blades alive to fight another day, over being annihilated then and there.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"He personally led a desperate rearguard action to buy time for the rest of us to flee.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"As a result, Kokuan-dono was arrested by the Republic, and nearly a hundred other warriors were killed in action.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"There hasn't been a shred of information about\nKokuan-dono's status since he was captured.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"We weren't even sure whether he was still alive.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Inago, just how legit is this intel?”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“My name is not Inago.”",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Answer the goddamn question!”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I have not confirmed its veracity.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I merely overheard a Republican officer mentioning it.”",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"She reports as she hangs her head remorsefully.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is Kokuan-dono doing in the Imperial Palace?”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Wasn't he captured by the Republican Army?”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Unfortunately... I cannot explain why myself.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“He may have been transferred to the Imperial Palace for some unknown reason.”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			{
"The palace's security is exclusively under the jurisdiction of Okonogi and his Forbidden Guard, with no Republican oversight.",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Why in the world would Kokuan-dono end up there if he was taken into custody by the Republican Army?",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			{
"Try as I might, I can't make any sense of the situation.",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Father is being held in... the Imperial Palace...?”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Hotori-sama, we must mount a rescue at once!”",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"At Koyozu's exclamation, the warriors of the Inou faction begin excitedly clamoring for a rescue operation.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"In response to the despair of losing our spellblades, they are desperately grasping at this sudden piece of incredible news.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			{
"On the other hand, many of the warriors in the Maki faction are wearing grim expressions.",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I see.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Akari mutters in comprehension.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			{
"It seems as though she's picked up on the factional dynamic within the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ina, you are surely exhausted, but I...”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Leave it to me, ma'am! I shall go confirm the veracity of this information at once.”",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We're counting on you.”",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“My life for fealty!”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"Lingering not a second longer, Koyuzu practically flies out of the headquarters.",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Maki lets out a long, conspicuous sigh as he watches the heavy doors slowly swing shut.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Acting chairman, you aren't seriously gonna propose we go rescue him, are you?”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"will",
{"/font"},
" be rescuing my father.”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Gimme a fuckin' break...”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Even if this information is totally legit, I'm against it.”",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Well, I wouldn't be opposed if he were just bein' held in some random warehouse.”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“But we're talkin' the Imperial Palace here.”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“The hell happened to the oh-so-wise acting chairman who tried to stop me from rushin' that place a few minutes ago?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The situation is completely different now.”",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"Maki frustratedly runs a hand through his hair.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Didn't you just say that we can't afford any more pointless sacrifices?”",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Once we bring my father back, he'll make the Sworn Blades stronger than ever.”",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm sure he'll even find a solution to this sudden loss of our spellblades!”",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Hahaha, d'you seriously think your old man's a god, or what?”",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“'Sides, all we know is that he might still be alive. No tellin' how he's actually doing.”",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“What's that supposed to mean?”",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“If they kept him alive this whole time, they must've been\nputtin' the screws to him all the while.”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Just how many of our comrades have been wrung out like cheap rags by them already?”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			{
"More than a few warriors have been returned to their families after they died in prison.",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			{
"Words can't even describe the horrific state most of their bodies were in.",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Sorry, but I ain't keen to change that old man's diapers.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Are you sure you wish to speak of him in that way?”",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You'll regret those words when my father comes back.”",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“If he comes back, you mean.”",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Hotori's already-sharp gaze takes on a dangerous glint.",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"It's clearly taking everything she's got to endure listening to Kokuan-dono being mocked like this.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			{
"Still, she barely manages to hold herself back.",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“My father is the rightful chairman of the Sworn Blades.”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“It is out of the question to refuse to rescue our chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You're doing a fine job as the chairman as is.”",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Let's just forget about that old bastard.”",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I'm the ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"acting",
{"/font"},
" chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The Sworn Blades should by all rights be commanded by my father.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Even you were a lot more respectful when he was still with us.”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Oh, now you've gone and said it...”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"Maki's hand slowly begins reaching for his waist, an amused smile playing across his lips.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			{
"Hotori isn't foolish enough to rise to this cheap provocation.",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"However, the gears are still in motion for an imminent clash between House Inou and House Maki.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			{
"If the two don't make peace here and now, it'll cause a schism in the Blades.",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Personal conflicts are strictly prohibited. Please set an example in your positions as acting and vice chairman.”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Back down for now. Don't do anything that you'll regret.”",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			{
"Maki casts a withering glare in my direction.",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“You really are one boring son of a bitch.”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If that is all I am, then so be it.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"No matter what he says or thinks, I have to prevent a schism.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Right when the going was gettin' good too, goddammit.”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			{
"Still standing, Maki spitefully casts a look down at Hotori, though he rests his grip on his blade.",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Times have changed, y'know?”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“There ain't no place for old fogeys anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"With that, he defiantly turns on his heel.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Maki!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“Let's get going, you lot!”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"Maki pointedly ignores Hotori as he makes for the exit.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			{
"All of the warriors of the Maki faction follow on his heels.",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Kazuma"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			{
"Maki pierces me with one last look right before he steps outside.",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What's that supposed to mean?”",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"He leaves without an answer.",
			},
		},
	},
